---
// src/pages/index.astro
const pageTitle = "Relieve Back Pain & Master Posture Correction | 5-Min Guide";
const pageDescription =
  "Evidence-based 5-minute daily movement routines, thoracic extension, core activation, and ergonomic workstation principles for back pain relief and posture correction.";
---

<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{pageTitle}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={pageDescription} />
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 antialiased selection:bg-emerald-600 selection:text-white">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-30 border-b border-slate-200 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur">
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl items-center justify-between px-4 py-4">
        <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-700 text-sm font-bold text-white">
            H
          </span>
          <span>Health<span class="text-emerald-700">Guide</span></span>
        </a>

        <nav class="hidden items-center gap-6 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 md:flex">
          <a href="#overview" class="hover:text-slate-900">Overview</a>
          <a href="#exercises" class="hover:text-slate-900">Exercises</a>
          <a href="#comparison" class="hover:text-slate-900">Comparison</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="hover:text-slate-900">FAQ</a>
        </nav>

        <a
          href="#exercises"
          class="rounded-lg bg-emerald-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-emerald-800"
        >
          Start 5-Min Guide
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-white py-16 md:py-20">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-emerald-800">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-600"></span>
          Evidence-Based Health Protocol 2026
        </div>

        <h1 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">
          Relieve Back Pain &amp; Master <span class="text-emerald-700">Posture Correction</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-lg">
          Simple, daily targeted movement routines and ergonomic principles designed to restore spinal alignment and strengthen core stability.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
          <a
            href="#exercises"
            class="rounded-lg bg-emerald-700 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-emerald-800"
          >
            Explore Daily Exercises &rarr;
          </a>
          <a
            href="#overview"
            class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50"
          >
            Read Summary
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <main class="mx-auto max-w-5xl space-y-16 px-4 py-14">
      <!-- TL;DR Summary -->
      <section id="overview" class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/70 p-6 sm:p-8">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-800">
          <span class="rounded bg-emerald-100 px-2.5 py-1">TL;DR Quick Summary</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-white px-2.5 py-1 text-slate-700 ring-1 ring-emerald-200">
            Answer Engine Optimized
          </span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="mt-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-2xl">
          What is the most effective way to correct posture and relieve lower back pain?
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          Effective posture correction combines targeted thoracic spine extension stretches, core stabilization exercises (such as dead bugs and planks), and ergonomic workstation adjustments. Performing 5-minute daily movement snacks reduces lumbar disc pressure, relieves muscular fatigue, and establishes sustainable spinal support within 4 to 6 weeks.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Core Pillar Exercises -->
      <section id="exercises">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
            Core Pillar Exercises
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">
            Daily targeted movements to relieve muscle tightness and build structural stability.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <div>
              <div class="inline-block rounded-md bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">
                01
              </div>
              <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Thoracic Extension</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
                Reverses forward-slumping computer posture by gently opening the chest and mid-back spine.
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="mt-6 inline-block w-fit rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800">
              2 Mins Daily
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <div>
              <div class="inline-block rounded-md bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">
                02
              </div>
              <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Glute &amp; Core Activation</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
                Strengthens deep abdominal muscles and gluteal bridges to stabilize the pelvic girdle.
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="mt-6 inline-block w-fit rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800">
              3 Mins Daily
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <div>
              <div class="inline-block rounded-md bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">
                03
              </div>
              <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Ergonomic Reset</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
                Adjust monitor height to eye level and keep feet flat on the floor to maintain neutral alignment.
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="mt-6 inline-block w-fit rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700">
              Workstation Check
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Comparison Table -->
      <section id="comparison">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
            Comparing Posture Approaches
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">
            Active movement vs. passive posture support braces.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white">
          <table class="w-full border-collapse text-left text-sm">
            <thead class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600">
              <tr>
                <th class="px-5 py-3.5">Approach</th>
                <th class="px-5 py-3.5">Primary Benefit</th>
                <th class="px-5 py-3.5">Long-Term Impact</th>
                <th class="px-5 py-3.5">Recommendation</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-200 text-slate-700">
              <tr>
                <td class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-slate-900">Active Core Exercises</td>
                <td class="px-5 py-4">Strengthens stabilizing muscles naturally</td>
                <td class="px-5 py-4">High (Sustainable results)</td>
                <td class="px-5 py-4">
                  <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-emerald-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800">
                    Recommended
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-slate-900">Passive Posture Braces</td>
                <td class="px-5 py-4">Temporary tactile reminder</td>
                <td class="px-5 py-4">Low (May weaken muscles if overused)</td>
                <td class="px-5 py-4">
                  <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-amber-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-800">
                    Use Short-Term Only
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FAQ -->
      <section id="faq">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
          Frequently Asked Questions
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-3">
          <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between font-semibold text-slate-900">
              <span>How long does it take to see posture improvements?</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">&#9660;</span>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
              Most individuals experience reduced muscle tension within 7 to 10 days of daily targeted stretching. Noticeable structural posture alignment typically occurs within 4 to 6 weeks of consistent core activation.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between font-semibold text-slate-900">
              <span>What is the best sleeping position for lower back pain?</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">&#9660;</span>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
              Sleeping on your back with a small pillow under your knees maintains the natural lumbar curve. Side sleepers should place a supportive pillow between their knees to align the hips and spine.
            </p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-white py-8">
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-2 px-4 text-sm text-slate-500 sm:flex-row">
        <p>Health &amp; Wellness Guide &copy; 2026</p>
        <p>Engineered for Google Search &amp; AI Answer Engines (AEO/GEO).</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
